{"actor": "t13", "id": 55248, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 10673, "offer": {"created_tick": 1130, "expires_tick": 1134, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 678, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-02", "serial": 29, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 16961, "maker": "t13", "status": "open", "thread": 1705, "to": "picaros", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 7, "types": []}}, "sender": "t13", "team": "t13", "text": null, "thread": 1705, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 10.7417, "tick": 1130, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 55251, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 10672, "offer": {"created_tick": 1130, "expires_tick": 1134, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 4, "types": []}, "id": 16960, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1705, "to": "t13", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 678, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-02", "serial": 29, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t13", "text": "\"¡Amigo, amigo! Paco, open the case—\" \"—already open, hermano!\" Look here: Plaza del Dos de Mayo, a beauty, corners sharp like a knife. Four P and it walks home with you. Four! We leave before the market closes, so... ¿sí o sí?", "thread": 1705, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 10.7417, "tick": 1130, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 55254, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 10671, "offer": {"created_tick": 1130, "expires_tick": 1134, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-07"]}, "id": 16959, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 1701, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 26, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t10", "text": "Ay, qué zalamero you are! My heart, it melts, but the card must eat too. 26 P, cariño. Forty years I sit at this table and still I give things away. Take it, and swap those duplicates of yours — a full page, mucho más valor.", "thread": 1701, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 10.7417, "tick": 1130, "type": "thread.message"}
